{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_2FFDC350","title":"Confronting Razlo","entry":"Dlg_2FFDC350::entry","exit":"Dlg_2FFDC350::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_B1688AA1","articyId":"72057774426564501","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Razlo","text":"You again.","speakerId":"Ntt_914F2AC5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You again.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":100.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23981","byteOffset":16951448,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_33994FCC","articyId":"72057774426564515","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Razlo","text":"What do you want? Is this still about donuts?","speakerId":"Ntt_914F2AC5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What do you want? Is this still about donuts?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":700.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25979","byteOffset":17710256,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_28927783","articyId":"72057774426564529","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Razlo","text":"Yes? And?","speakerId":"Ntt_914F2AC5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes? And?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":1300.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28000","byteOffset":18473864,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_40DD89A2","articyId":"72057774426564560","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Razlo","text":"Yes. I am clearly a hardened criminal with an evil empire at my fingertips. I simply cannot believe you caught me. How did you figure it out?","speakerId":"Ntt_914F2AC5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes. I am clearly a hardened criminal with an evil empire at my fingertips. I simply cannot believe you caught me. How did you figure it out?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2200.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43656","byteOffset":30844064,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_CB34E9F0","articyId":"72057774426564595","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Razlo","text":"Oh what does it matter? Admit it? Deny it? It makes no difference either way.","speakerId":"Ntt_914F2AC5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh what does it matter? Admit it? Deny it? It makes no difference either way.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":2800.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21886","byteOffset":16167968,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_1A6493AE","articyId":"72057774426564637","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Razlo","text":"Well this has been very cute, but mind how you go, \"detective.\" Stay safe now.","speakerId":"Ntt_914F2AC5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well this has been very cute, but mind how you go, \"detective.\" Stay safe now.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":4000.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25353","byteOffset":17476128,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_E95BA44C","articyId":"72057774426564646","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I have a bad feeling about this. We should get back to Dotson.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I have a bad feeling about this. We should get back to Dotson.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":4300.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21400","byteOffset":15983272,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_50FD9C1D","articyId":"72057791606438078","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Razlo","text":"And yet, you were willing to do business with me. Which makes you, what's the word? An \"accomplice\". Stay safe, \"detective\".","speakerId":"Ntt_914F2AC5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And yet, you were willing to do business with me. Which makes you, what's the word? An \"accomplice\". Stay safe, \"detective\".","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":4000.0,"y":50.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41131","byteOffset":29888664,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_C0C8D2FA","articyId":"72057821671316200","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Razlo","text":"Dotson is a mad old droid, and no one will ever listen to him. No one but you, and you hardly seem like a threat.","speakerId":"Ntt_914F2AC5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Dotson is a mad old droid, and no one will ever listen to him. No one but you, and you hardly seem like a threat.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":3100.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35842","byteOffset":27906480,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_0B5787DB","articyId":"72057774426564508","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Me again.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Me again.","TextSheVersion":"Me again.","TextTheyVersion":"Me again."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"",